OOP increment toward separating Ui, Storage, Parser, and TaskList responsibilities. Behavior is intentionally unchanged.\n\nTest: python3 .codex/skills/test-ui/scripts/run_ui_tests.py --plan test/ui-test-plan.md\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":98,"deletions":41}}},{"hash":"3a1509bfa7ac5a531ee26b36d899eb675e4adbec","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce command classes","messageBody":"Add an abstract Command base class plus concrete Add, Delete, Exit, List, Mark, and Unmark commands.\n\nMove user command interpretation into Parser so Duke no longer contains the command-selection chain.\n\nExtract Storage so commands can save task-list changes before showing success messages, preserving the existing behavior.\n\nDuke now coordinates Ui, Storage, Parser, and Command execution, moving closer to the stretch-goal run-loop structure while still using ArrayList\u003cTask\u003e until TaskList is extracted.\n\nTest: python3 .codex/skills/test-ui/scripts/run_ui_tests.py --plan test/ui-test-plan.md\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":318,"deletions":219}}},{"hash":"9a0544800e23afecb74b9c39c128c27977068e0a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"A-MoreOOP","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b3a684a73ce0853658a86c6e10099c21e7706314","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organize classes into packages","messageBody":"Move the source files under the computah package hierarchy while keeping src/main/java as the source root.\n\nGroup command, parser, storage, task, ui, exception, and util classes into responsibility-based packages and add the required package declarations/imports.\n\nUpdate the project test-ui runner to compile Java sources recursively and launch computah.Duke.\n\nTest: python3 .codex/skills/test-ui/scripts/run_ui_tests.py --plan test/ui-test-plan.md\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":103,"deletions":0},"md":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"fcb0